3. **BASKET 3 — Woods:** Cedarwood oil Virginia (500), Cedarwood EO (345), Polysantol (310), Kephalis (120), Cashmeran (50).
4. **BASKET 4 — Wood modifiers and ambers:** Benzyl Benzoate (300), Hexyl Salicylate (150).
5. **BASKET 6 — Musks:** Ethylene Brassylate (500).
6. **BASKET 7 — Muguet and lavender:** Ethyl Linalool (180), Lavender EO Bontaux (160), Linalyl Acetate (100), Clary Sage EO (10), Linalool (10), Spike Lavender EO (10), Lavender EO High Altitude (10).
7. **BASKET 8 — Jasmine, indole, and magnolia:** Jessemal (225), Dihydrojasmone (30), Cis Jasmone (20).
8. **BASKET 11 — Iris and orris:** Alpha Isomethyl Ionone (200), Irotyl (120), Dihydro Beta Ionone (60), Beta Ionone (20), Alpha Ionone (10), Orivone (10).
9. **BASKET 12 — Edible smells:** Tonkarome (370), Coumarin (300), Heliotropal (140), Tonka Bean Absolute (100), Immortelle Absolute (20), Benzaldehyde (10).
10. **BASKET 13 — Edible spices:** Cardamom EO (230), Terpinyl Acetate (220), Black Pepper EO (20), Juniper Berry EO (10).
11. **BASKET 15 — Fruits:** Bergamot FCF (160), Damascenone (20), Petitgrain EO (20).
12. **BASKET 16 — Aldehydes:** Aldehyde C10 (30), Aldehyde C11 (30).
13. **BASKET 17 — Green smelling things:** Suederal (30), Leafovert (20), Beta-Pinene (10), Dynascone (10), Rosemary EO (10), Scentenal (10).
14. **CARRIER / TECHNICAL:** Dipropylene Glycol (20).

Stir after each basket. Bring concentrate to exactly 6,000 uL. Add ethanol only under separately authorized physical compounding.

